  "description": "In the Joseon Dynasty, Kunnomi, a herbalist in a small village, dreams of marrying his childhood friend Okbun. One day, Kunnomi discovers a place where the expensive herb \"resurrection plant\" grows wild, and is excited at the prospect of making a lot of money from it, but falls off a cliff and nearly dies. On the verge of death, Kunnomi accidentally eats the resurrection plant that a fox spirit has been carefully tending for 100 years, and both his life and his groin are restored.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/big_dick_guy), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/big_dick_guy) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://lezhin.jp/comic/big_dick_guy), [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_4106)",
